              variables.podMeta.annotations[k] == 'runtime/default' ||
              variables.podMeta.annotations[k].startsWith('localhost/')))
          message: container.apparmor.security.beta.kubernetes.io/* annotations must be runtime/default or localhost/<profile>. If this workload needs it, add a posture exception for restrict-apparmor.
